5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The spaces are tight. I worry about friction. Let’s look at the complaint log and the morning departures.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Misaki. The morning rush is indeed stressful. I’ll check the rain exposure and the sticker register to see who uses them daily.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I’m curious about the money side. I’ll check the building account ledger and the treasurer’s handover file.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I’ll examine the five years of minutes and the neighbouring block’s secretary account. We need to see how past duties actually collapsed.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about fairness! I’ll check the complaint log and the sticker register to see if the same people always grab the best spots.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
